### R186 payments_live_announcement / every method
💳 *Match fees now go through MatchTime*

Here's how it works:
• After each game I'll DM everyone who played a link to pay their share.
• You can pay by card, Apple Pay, Google Pay or straight from your bank.
• The amount is the match fee split between the players, with the card or bank fee added on top.
• If you haven't paid, I'll send you a reminder.
• Paying Kemal directly is fine too. Just DM me *Paid* and Kemal will confirm it.

