### RSQ5 weekly routine settings
Weekly routine
How your squad is put together each week. Each setting stays off until you turn it on.
Rolling squad: Everyone who played last time is in again, unless they say OUT.
(i) When this is on, everyone who played the last match is automatically in for the next one, and only needs to say OUT if they can't make it. Players who were on the waiting list, guests without a phone number and anyone who has left the group are not carried over. The squad is carried over at 08:00 the morning after each match, so you have the night to remove anyone who didn't turn up. Anyone still on the list at the final whistle counts as having played, for payments and ratings.
