### WDL4 weekly deadline settings
Drop-out deadline: The last day and time players can pull out without it counting as late.
(i) The last time players can pull out without it counting as late. MatchTime reminds the group 3 hours before, then messages the admins with who is out and who is waiting. An OUT after the deadline still counts, and the admins are told it was late.
List published: When MatchTime posts the final list in the group.
(i) When MatchTime posts the final list in the group: who is playing and who is on the waiting list. With this and a drop-out deadline set, MatchTime stops the daily 17:00 post, except on match day.
Day / Time / Not set
Sunday, Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday, Friday, Saturday
Save / Clear / Weekly deadlines saved
Pick both a day and a time, or neither.
That day or time is not valid.
Pick a time between 08:00 and 21:30.
The drop-out deadline has to come before the list is published.
On match day, pick a time before kickoff.

